flowchart LR
 _Prelude_(["Make an example of stubborn business owners and force them to pay Duke&#39;s protection money."])
 _A1_(["The team arrives at the market ready to crack some skulls and extract what&#39;s owed."])
 _A1_C1_{"Lookout scans the area for undercover cops, wary of interference."}
 _A1_C1P_["Lookout rumbles a plainclothes cop lurking nearby."]
 _A2_(["Negotiator stalks toward the officer and fixes him with a cold, menacing stare."])
 _A2_C1_{"Negotiator reveals the crew is here on business, offering the cop a cut of the take."}
 _A2_C1F_["The officer balks at being offered a kickback."]
 _A2_C2_{"Muscle warns him that bad things happen to honest cops."}
 _A2_C2P_["Intimidated by Muscle’s tough demeanor, the cop accepts the kickback."]
 _A3_(["The team enters the bazaar, telling the moonshine seller her protection payment is due."])
 _A3_1_(["The threat is clear–comply or the store won&#39;t exist this time tomorrow."])
 _A3_C1_{"Sensing hesitation, Enforcer takes charge and begins to intimidate the seller."}
 _A3_C1F_["The debtor ignores Enforcer&#39;s demands and continues with her business."]
 _A3_C2_{"Negotiator leans in, voice low and menacing, to ask if the seller loves her family."}
 _A3_C2P_["Fear etched on her face, the seller agrees to pay for protection."]
 _A4_R2_(["The seller hands over a modest sum, claiming it&#39;s all she&#39;s got."])
 _A4_(["Arsonist isn&#39;t satisfied and wants to send a message by torching this store."])
 _A4_C1_{"Arsonist smashes some moonshine bottles, pours over gas, and strikes a match."}
 _A4_C1F_["The gasoline-alcohol mix barely catches–this is some low-quality moonshine."]
 _A4_C2_{"Arsonist splashes out a glug of gasoline and tries to nourish the piss-poor fire."}
 _A4_C2P_["The fire finally ignites and begins to spread rapidly."]
 _B5_(["The debtor calls for help to put out the fire."])
 _B5_C1_{"Muscle uses his body to block the entrance, ensuring no interference."}
 _B5_C1F_["Two do-gooders gang up on Muscle, shoving him away and rushing to the fire."]
 _B5_C2_{"Enforcer and Lookout band together to stop the intruders from entering."}
 _B5_C2P_["They wrestle the vigilantes out of the store and shove them to the ground."]
 _B5_1_(["The flames rapidly consume the liquor store, turning it into an unstoppable inferno."])
 _B5_2_(["For their own safety, the owner and Muscle have no choice but to flee."])
 _B5_3_(["The cop approaches, demanding an extra kickback to cover up the team’s destruction."])
 _B5S_(["The team pays up and quickly leaves the scene to avoid further consequences."])
 _A2_C1P_["The cop accepts the deal, agreeing to turn a blind eye as the gang conducts its shakedown."]
 _A4_R3_(["Reluctantly, the seller coughs up some cash, albeit not the whole amount."])
 _A4_C1P_["The mixture of gas and moonshine ignites, causing a small blaze to break out."]
 _A5_(["A passer-by notices the flames and tries to intervene."])
 _A5_C1_{"Muscle tries to intimidate the meddler, blocking him from entering the store."}
 _A5_C1F_["Two do-gooders gang up on Muscle, shoving him away and rushing to the fire."]
 _A5_C2_{"Enforcer and Lookout work together to keep the intruders at bay."}
 _A5_C2P_["The crew wrestles the vigilantes out of the store, shoving them to the ground."]
 _A6_2_(["Muscle forces the shopkeeper to watch as her stock burns before her eyes."])
 _A6_3_(["With no way to stop the blaze, the concerned citizens disperse."])
 _A6_4_(["Terrified by what they’ve just seen, the other sellers quickly offer up their payments."])
 _A6_R3_(["The team collects what&#39;s owed, with everyone grateful for the protection of Duke."])
 _A7_(["With tensions high, the cop runs over, keen to secure his payout before things escalate."])
 _A7_1_(["The cop&#39;s hand hovers over his radio, conflicted between fear and duty."])
 _A7_C1_{"Negotiator quickly takes the lead, offering the cop a 5% cut of the cash."}
 _A7_C1P_["Afraid to haggle with psychopaths, the cop reluctantly accepts the deal."]
 _A8_(["The cop snatches his money, counting it openly before the watching crowd."])
 _A8_C1_{"With an exasperated expression, Muscle gestures sharply for the cop to leave."}
 _A8_C1F_["The cop loudly claims he&#39;s been short-changed and demands more, or he&#39;ll call for backup."]
 _A8_1_(["Muscle hands over the cash then storms off, frustrated at the officer&#39;s greed."])
 _A8S2_(["Reluctant to provoke the T.C.P.D., the team follows Muscle without a word."])
 _A3_C1P_["The seller, feeling threatened, agrees to pay the protection demands."]
 _A6_R4_(["A few store owners come up short, blaming slow business. The take is less than expected."])
 _A7_C1F_["The officer rejects the proposal, demanding a 10% cut."]
 _A7_C2_{"Negotiator insists that it isn&#39;t their cash to give as it belongs to Duke."}
 _A7_C2P_["Unwilling to defy Duke, the cop backs down and accepts a 5% share."]
 _A1_C1F_["Lookout fails to detect any sign of a police presence."]
 _A1_1_(["The team forms a conspicuous group among the crowd, intent on making its presence felt."])
 _A1_1_Cont_(["An undercover police officer crashes the party and demands to know what&#39;s going on."])
 _A1_C2_{"Feeling smug, Enforcer attempts to assert dominance, emboldened by the crew."}
 _A1_C2P_["Enforcer’s commanding presence gets results; the cop is suddenly all ears."]
 _A2_1_(["Negotiator saunters over with a grin, eager to strike a deal."])
 _A8_C1P_["Chastened, the cop stuffs the cash in his pocket and walks away, avoiding eye contact."]
 _A8S_(["The team members depart with their pockets full and the bazaar owners shaken."])
 _A5_C2F_["One plucky individual manages to slip through and extinguish the fire."]
 _A5_1_(["Smelling weakness, the other store owners confront the crew."])
 _A5_2_(["The police officer intervenes to prevent further conflict as tensions escalate."])
 _A5_3_(["In the melee, some of the extorted cash falls from Enforcer&#39;s pocket."])
 _A5S_(["With things getting out of hand, the team scrambles to avoid being arrested."])
 _A7_C2F_["The cop folds his arms and raises his eyebrows, reaffirming his stance."]
 _A7_2_(["Suddenly, more undercover cops emerge, with every one of them wanting a cut."])
 _A7S_(["Enforcer settles with the cops and leads the team out, its earnings depleted."])
 _B5_C2F_["The will of the people wins and the flames are stomped out by the spirited saviors."]
 _B5_4_(["In a fit of rage, the crew unleashes a savage beating on one of the intruders."])
 _B5_5_(["Alerted to the fracas, the cops sprint to aid the civilian before a body bag is needed."])
 _B5F_(["Enforcer and Muscle are left to face the music as the others escape."])
 _A5_C1P_["Muscle holds the would-be heroes back, letting the fire engulf the store."]
 _A6_(["With no one to help, the store owner is left to tackle the fire by herself."])
 _A6_1_(["Terrified by what they&#39;ve just seen, the other sellers quickly offer up their payments."])
 _A6_R1_(["Several store owners cough up the cash for next month&#39;s protection payments too!"])
 _A4_R1_(["She hands over most of the amount demanded, but she&#39;s still a little short."])
 _A6_R2_(["The store owners don&#39;t have much but the team manages to collect more than expected."])
 _A3_C2F_["The vendor spits in Negotiator&#39;s face, curses at him, and shouts for help."]
 _A3_2_(["Despite her plea, nobody comes to the shopkeeper&#39;s aid."])
 _A3_C3_{"Muscle twists the seller&#39;s arm behind her back, threatening to snap it."}
 _A3_C3P_["Shrieking in pain, the seller relents and agrees to pay the protection money."]
 _A4_R4_(["The seller falls short and is only able to cover some of the amount demanded."])
 _B4_(["Arsonist is pissed off and threatens to set the whole store on fire."])
 _B4_C1_{"Goaded by the crew, Arsonist douses the place in fuel and strikes a match."}
 _B4_C1P_["Flames engulf the moonshine and Arsonist cackles as he bolts from the store."]
 _A4_C2F_["The owner kicks the gas can from Arsonist&#39;s hand and stamps out the flames."]
 _A4_1_(["Bucked up by her success, the store owner puffs out her chest and berates the team."])
 _A4_2_(["Enforcer agitatedly assures her that they will return to collect what is owed."])
 _A4S_(["The team departs before its reputation is tarnished any further."])
 _B5_C1P_["Some do-gooders try to break through but Muscle holds them back."]
 _A2_C2F_["The cop radios for backup, refusing to yield to such an overt threat."]
 _A2F_(["A swarm of cops descends on the crew, arresting every last one of them."])
 _A1_C2F_["The cop stands firm against the intimidation, demanding the crew disperse."]
 _A1_2_(["Muscle slaps the cop and starts barking like a dog, hoping to scare him off."])
 _A1_3_(["Emerging from the crowd, two undercover officers make themselves known."])
 _A1F_(["The team is caught off guard as the cops spring into action, arresting them in a flash."])
 _A4_R5_(["The seller scrapes together what she has but only covers a fraction of the amount demanded."])
 _B4_C1F_["The fire ignites a small pool of gas but burns out rapidly, failing to light the store."]
 _B4_1_(["Losing patience, Arsonist gets heavy-handed with the accelerant."])
 _B4_2_(["With the flick of a match, the flames flare up and spiral out of control."])
 _B4_3_(["Arsonist screams as the flames consume him, while the others flee in terror."])
 _B4_4_(["Panicking, Arsonist charges toward the team, scattering the protection money."])
 _B4F_(["The team beats down the fire with their hands, then drags Arsonist to hospital."])
 _A3_C3F_["The seller laughs like a maniac, cackling even as Muscle fully breaks her arm."]
 _A3_3_(["Having observed the brutal punishment, a trio of cops descends on the crew."])
 _A3F_(["As the cops help the wounded seller, the crew uses intimidation to escape the angry mob."])

